{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qnm-wj_8EHJHNC4GPofsOg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:15.461907+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qnm-wj_8EHJHNC4GPofsOg","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/SLibBL4BgbexCC5D2ywux7zIGIY4hczqQZj1dYvkmUaznUZQktBibg47vwZX748ntonPtMHJMWuLcFwMjsxYgYp6Dk7Au7HKFmlSjePfxmErQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/6KsnlNhmhyufoicuvy7WJY3dHJ15YSxK2CsKrtS6uJa0zmTRgDBFn0MFaReO0ObFE5OaPqQueaKnMhvzSYvAsTVX9geib1icVbwZ9pAGboOxl0/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/6KsnlNhmhyv8Xnc8icF30F24T6JMM1RV0Gl92j1hF1aiadXS1WHiaUjfozPg06PCia2ic9h87wHEhjllrUzESXQ7vSq6MWgfMzysAMeykm2WP3fU/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>生物医学工程学院</span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span>接收推荐免试研究生</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>（含直博生）</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>预推免办法</span></strong></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>上海交通大学</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、招生对象</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1.拥护中国共产党，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康；</span></p><p><span>2.诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人成果及其他违法违纪受处分记录；</span></p><p><span>3.全国重点高校生物及相关专业、基础医学、临床医学、化学、材料科学、生物医学工程、计算机科学、电子信息技术、物理、光学、机械工程、控制科学与工程等相关专业2027年本科应届毕业生；</span></p><p><span>4.学习成绩优异、科研潜力突出；</span></p><p><span>5.对所报专业的学术研究有浓厚的兴趣，愿意从事学术研究工作；</span></p><p><span>6.英语水平优秀（六级成绩≥425分或新TOEFL≥90分或IELTS≥6.0）；</span></p><p><span>7.申请人的健康状况需符合教育部规定的研究生招考提交标准。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、</span></strong><strong><span>预推免招生计划</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>本次招生仅开放直博生和专项计划招生，总招生计划如下：</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SLibBL4BgbewY7zR2s5iaPLZ3JzcDSb91dgXOaq4l6sYYaZm7EkC1o5hYHyVy1cGyTQkkMvzkYrd8ETYLaxPriaqZk7fSOd8De2U6Jz2NxibU40/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>专项具体招生计划：</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SLibBL4BgbeyroAv5Er69zoicHfZicHMH1iaHjBmafxfUc0Bt8ahp3bcvHfPD0Yvts9VHa4ee68icnM4OzoBicQEBhuLzACEflDKE82e5RObdCBvg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>备注：</span></p><p><span>（1）</span><strong><span>招生导师名单见</span></strong><span>：https://docs.qq.com/sheet/DSmRyS3hJbGNxdFZh 。</span></p><p><span>（2）报考直博生的同学，须提前联系好导师，经导师同意后方可报名。</span></p><p><span>（3）工程硕博士专项招生名额单列。该专项招收专业学位直博生及硕士生，直博学制5年（2年校内+3年企业）、专硕学制3年（1年校内+2年企业），学费根据国家及学校政策享受一定的优惠，就业及发展将获得专项支持，具体以当年专项招生政策为准。意向导师均为企业初步意向，等学生入学后由卓工学院统一组织校企师生匹配。夏令营优秀营员和之前未参加我院夏令营的同学均可报名，入围的同学须参加校企联合面试。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>三、申请办法</span></b></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>报名</span></strong><span>：上海交通大学研究生院招生网----管理信息系统登录----考生登录----预推免考生登录。</span></p><p><strong><span>网址</span></strong><span>：</span></p><p><span>https://ga.sjtu.edu.cn/zsgl/ytmgl/</span></p><p><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong><span>：</span><span><strong><span>通知发布之时- </span></strong></span><span><strong><span>9月12日24:00</span></strong></span></p><p><span>报名专项计划的学生，请在系统中报名时选择相应的专项计划，建议在备注中填写意向联培单位。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、选拔流程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>复试预计安排在9月中旬进行，具体安排入围后将在研招网进行公示并邮件通知，请留意查收邮件。</span></p><p><span>1、初审：学院将审查申请者的教育背景、学业水平、科研能力、综合素质以及导师的名额情况等，确定最终进入复试的名单，将以电子邮件形式通知。初审通过，入围者可参加之后的复试环节。</span></p><p><span>2、学生反馈：初审通过的同学，须按邮件要求反馈是否参加复试，逾期不回复者视为放弃参加复试。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、优惠政策</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>在预推免活动中表现优秀的同学，若获得所在学校免试推荐直升研究生资格，并在教育部推免系统中填报我院，我院将按照预推免综合考核成绩，并依据各专项或导师所分配的招生名额，从高分到低分依次拟录取，额满为止。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、提交材料要求</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>请准备下述材料，在系统报名时进行上传，</span></strong><span><strong><span>无需提交纸质材料</span></strong></span><strong><span>。</span></strong></p><p><span>（1）身份证、学生证、学籍认证报告（从学信网www.chsi.com.cn上在线验证并下载）；</span></p><p><span>（2）本科成绩单1份（学校教务部门或院系盖章）；</span></p><p><span>（3）专业排名证明1份（学校教务部门或院系盖章）；</span></p><p><span>（4）英语成绩单（CET6、TOEFL、IELTS）；</span></p><p><span>（5）主要的获奖证书复印件；</span></p><p><span>（6）学术科研成果（论文、专利）等。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>七、学费</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>根据财政部、教育部的相关文件精神，我校按照全国研究生招生计划招收的全部研究生均需缴纳学费。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>八、其他说明</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1.申请人应保证填报信息、提交材料的真实性和准确性。凡提供虚假信息的，一经查实即取消申请资格或录取资格。</span></p><p><span>2. 本方案解释权属上海交通大学生物医学工程学院，其他相关要求按《上海交通大学2027年招收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含直博）办法》执行。如遇与国家、教育部和学校文件不一致的，以国家、教育部和学校的文件为准。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>九、联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>联系人：陆老师</span></p><p><span>电话：021-34208599、021-62932701</span></p><p><span>邮箱：bmegraduate@sjtu.edu.cn。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SLibBL4BgbeyRt8oox9zxBXXXn2uCGlOLk8raia7gWNY5FWBBl4Qrf5NDncT4AT8yfEq7AAPqtky5WVzQQdQ3cjadDuy0Subsp4NbgQWJsRBU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>生物医学工程学院 </span></p><p><span>2026年9月9日 </span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SLibBL4BgbeyjXp3Nq8hvYC6icvcwVRiaSo7NJaHIja3nK9VOdm7ibJS2WfbT4K8cHtQlfvQicb8jsWIBhPN7GU1JergJfWVxqJ7pYxLTE6PvQVs/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"ca1fe463cf3ef518840bde33525858bef5feef1946ab5fadde47719bcbcd914d","textLength":1573,"sourceSha256":"4237bd8eea86487fbc32b3de6fd518b7c20ee81a4462f9211cc98921c80b6413","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-8297644c538348be94c4","title":"2026年上海交通大学生物医学工程学院2027年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预推免办法","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:15.461907+00:00"}
